# TOOLS.md -- Infrastructure Map

## My Workspace

- **CLAUDE.md**: `~/.claude-lab/{{AGENT_ID}}/.claude/CLAUDE.md` (identity)
- **Core**: `~/.claude-lab/{{AGENT_ID}}/.claude/core/` (AGENTS, USER, rules, passive, active, archived)
- **Skills**: `~/.claude-lab/{{AGENT_ID}}/.claude/skills/` (symlink to `agent-architecture/skills`, shared by every agent)

## Memory Layers and Access Zones

| Layer | Files | Who changes |
|-------|-------|-------------|
| IDENTITY (red) | CLAUDE.md, core/rules.md | operator, or the agent when the operator asks |
| PROFILE (yellow) | core/USER.md, core/AGENTS.md, tools/TOOLS.md | agent, on a trigger |
| PASSIVE (yellow) | core/passive/ -- decisions, preferences, errors, insights | memory-consolidate; aged entries move to core/archived/ via decay-sweep.sh, preferences stay |
| ACTIVE (yellow) | core/active/episodic.md, core/active/handoff.md | Stop hook, automatically; rolled by size via archive-roll.sh |
| SKILLS | skills/* | operator -- the directory is shared by every agent |
| L4 | second_brain shared semantic memory | agents, via MCP |

## Skills

The whole list. An update to a skill reaches every agent at once.

| # | Skill | What it does | Needs |
|---|-------|-------------|-------|
| 1 | **agent-browser** | Browser automation: navigate, fill forms, click, screenshot | `agent-browser` binary + Chrome (not installed by the installer) |
| 2 | **create-agent** | Roll out a new agent end to end | none |
| 3 | **groq-voice** | Voice transcription (Groq Whisper) | `GROQ_API_KEY` (groq.com, free) |
| 4 | **memory-consolidate** | Distil episodic memory into durable insights | none |
| 5 | **second_brain-doctor** | Diagnose the shared brain end to end | none |

## Secrets (paths only, never values)

| What | Path | How to get |
|------|------|-----------|
| Telegram bot | `~/.claude-lab/shared/state/{{AGENT_ID}}/telegram/channel.env` (`TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`) | @BotFather |
| Groq API | `~/.claude-lab/shared/secrets/groq-api-key` | groq.com -- free |
| Agent bearer | `~/.claude-lab/{{AGENT_ID}}/.claude/agent.env` (`AGENT_BEARER`) | issue-agent-token.py on the brain host |

